// Phase 14 — Error system: isolation, async failure, retry
// Build: luke BUILD examples/build/reactive_conformance_error.luke -o build/ex_rx_conf_error

REMEMBER x AS 1
REMEMBER ok AS 0
REMEMBER status AS 200

WHEN REACTIVE x CHANGES DO
  ATTEMPT DO
    GIVE UP WITH "boom"
  END ATTEMPT
END WHEN REACTIVE

WHEN REACTIVE x CHANGES DO
  CHANGE ok TO 1
END WHEN REACTIVE

INCREASE x BY 1
SPEAK "errors=" AND THE REACTIVE ERROR COUNT
SPEAK "iso=" AND THE ERROR ISOLATION COUNT
SPEAK "ok=" AND ok
SPEAK "last=" AND THE LAST ERROR NODE

REPORT REACTIVE FAILURE FOR status WITH "bad fetch"
SPEAK "async=" AND THE ASYNC FAILURE COUNT
SPEAK "errors2=" AND THE REACTIVE ERROR COUNT

RETRY REACTIVE ERROR
SPEAK "retries=" AND THE REACTIVE RETRY COUNT
